  "injection": "Selected positive progress calls CORE::syswrite with a bounded shorter request. A selected zero/EIO or undef/EIO return occurs without a syscall at offset 0, 1, floor(length/2), or length-1. Record actual and reported results separately, actual writer identity/CLOEXEC/size before and after, complete buffer digest and accepted slice bytes. No close override or observer recovery.",
